1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,690
One of history's deadliest wars almost never

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:03,300
happened.

3
00:00:03,544 --> 00:00:05,314
A wrong turn, a stalled engine,

4
00:00:05,544 --> 00:00:07,694
and two gunshots changed the world forever.

5
00:00:08,178 --> 00:00:10,048
June 28, 1914.

6
00:00:10,384 --> 00:00:13,344
Archduke Franz Ferdinand, heir to the Austro-Hungarian

7
00:00:13,344 --> 00:00:15,704
throne, rides through Sarajevo with his

8
00:00:15,704 --> 00:00:16,394
wife, Sophie.

9
00:00:16,741 --> 00:00:18,871
Along the route, six assassins are waiting.

10
00:00:19,326 --> 00:00:20,446
At ten past ten,

11
00:00:20,446 --> 00:00:21,596
one of them throws a bomb.

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,260
It bounces off the folded roof and explodes

13
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,330
under the next car,

14
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,810
wounding around twenty people.

15
00:00:26,938 --> 00:00:28,508
The Archduke is unharmed.

16
00:00:28,618 --> 00:00:29,508
The plot has failed.

17
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:30,650
At the town hall,

18
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,910
he is furious: "I came here on a visit,

19
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,320
and I am greeted with bombs!"

20
00:00:34,781 --> 00:00:36,931
He decides to visit the wounded in hospital,

21
00:00:37,161 --> 00:00:38,811
driving straight along the river.

22
00:00:38,974 --> 00:00:40,484
But no one tells his driver.

23
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:41,850
At the Latin Bridge,

24
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,250
the cars ahead turn right,

25
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,730
and his driver follows.

26
00:00:45,031 --> 00:00:46,931
The governor shouts: "Wrong way!" The driver

27
00:00:46,931 --> 00:00:48,261
brakes, tries to reverse,

28
00:00:48,491 --> 00:00:49,521
and the engine stalls.

29
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:53,096
Standing five feet away is 19-year-old Gavrilo

30
00:00:53,096 --> 00:00:53,726
Princip.

31
00:00:53,784 --> 00:00:55,354
He had missed his chance that morning.

32
00:00:55,984 --> 00:00:57,894
Now his target is right in front of him.

33
00:00:58,175 --> 00:00:59,885
He steps forward and fires twice.

34
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,321
The first bullet strikes the Archduke.

35
00:01:02,391 --> 00:01:03,561
The second strikes Sophie.

36
00:01:04,071 --> 00:01:05,401
Within the hour, both are dead.

37
00:01:05,762 --> 00:01:07,702
One month later, Austria-Hungary declares

38
00:01:07,702 --> 00:01:08,852
war on Serbia.

39
00:01:09,048 --> 00:01:10,318
Alliances pull in Russia,

40
00:01:10,488 --> 00:01:11,838
Germany, France and Britain.

41
00:01:12,172 --> 00:01:14,372
An estimated 20 million people would die

42
00:01:14,372 --> 00:01:15,862
in the war that followed.

43
00:01:16,232 --> 00:01:17,882
All because of one wrong turn.

